<title>USA: OP-TECH names president, restructures debt.</title>
<headline>OP-TECH names president, restructures debt.</headline>
<dateline>SYRACUSE, N.Y. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>OP-TECH Environmental Services Inc said on Friday that it has named Anthony Pongonis president of the company.</p>
<p>OP-TECH also said that it has arranged a favorable restructuring of its debt with the company's two largest creditors.</p>
<p>Pongonis, who was previously manager of corporate business development with Clean Harbors Inc, replaces interim president, Cornelius Murphy, who will remain on the board of directors.</p>
</text>
